  "question": {
    "text": "Let $a_1, a_2, a_3 \\ldots$ be in an A.P. such that $\\sum_{\\mathrm{k}=1}^{12} \\mathrm{a}_{2 \\mathrm{k}-1}=-\\frac{72}{5} \\mathrm{a}_1, \\mathrm{a}_1 \\neq 0$. If $\\sum_{\\mathrm{k}=1}^{\\mathrm{n}} \\mathrm{a}_{\\mathrm{k}}=0$, then n is:",
    "image": null
  },
