  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let $a_1=a$, common difference $=d$<br/>$a_1+a_3+a_5+\\ldots \\ldots+a_{23}=-\\frac{72}{5} a$<br/>$\\frac{12}{2}[2 a+11 \\times 2 d]=-\\frac{72}{5} a$<br/>$12 a+132 d=-\\frac{72}{5} a$<br/>$132 a+132 \\times 5 d=0$<br/>$\\mathrm{a}=-5 \\mathrm{~d}$<br/>$\\frac{\\mathrm{n}}{2}(2 \\mathrm{a}+(\\mathrm{n}-1) \\mathrm{d})=0 \\Rightarrow-10 \\mathrm{~d}+\\mathrm{nd}-\\mathrm{d}=0$<br/>$\\mathrm{n}=11$",
    "image": null
  },
